<title>SPAIN: Spain's CNMV suspends Radiotronica trade.</title>
<headline>Spain's CNMV suspends Radiotronica trade.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's national stock market commission CNMV said on Friday it had suspended trade in electronic equipment firm Radiotronica.</p>
<p>Earlier today Radiotronica said it would dismiss 652 workers for &quot;economic reasons.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
